      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That red line is a classic sign of an infection spreading up your arm, and you are absolutely right to be freaked out.\nYou should immediately stop trying to wait it out and go to the ER right now because this is a medical emergency.\nAntiseptic alone will not stop a spreading infection, and the shivers and coldness are your body's way of telling you it's serious.\nPlease do not delay; getting to a hospital immediately is the only way to save your arm.",
